Because Mimic PC is no longer accepting new accounts, the workshop has transitioned to the RunComfy platform. 
The following steps outline how to set up and execute the required workflows in this new environment.

Account Setup: 
Navigate to the RunComfy platform. (runcomfy.com)
Create an account
Confirm your registration via email
Once on the platform, setup a username to enter the environment.

Funding: Select the "pay as you go" plan. 
Add a minimum of $10 to your account to cover the workshop resources.
For what we're doing, this should provide anywhere from 5 to 10 hours depending on the configuration you select.

Launching Workflows: 
Use this link to access the preconfigured environment
https://www.runcomfy.com/comfyui-workflows/my-workflows?shared_workflow=3d9034fe-27f4-8f82-7286-abfe0d01e77e
Select "Run this workflow" (the Medium/16GB option is sufficient, but you can select a larger configuration)
Set a machine stop timer to manage resource usage, usually 15 minutes for each lab and launch the environment

Execution: 
Wait 3-5 minutes for the environment to load. 
For Lab1 - it will have an audio error, this is because the original file is not available. 
That's fine as you upload your own audio file (created via yt-dlp) to use with the various nodes.
 
Finishing:
When finished, click "Stop" on the top menu bar to end the session.
